  "description": "Kim Doha is a notorious womanizer, known for sleeping around with just about any woman. One day, a check is suddenly thrust in front of him.  \n\n“What?”   \n\n“I want to buy a night with you. How much?\"   \n\nThe woman boldly offering to pay for a night with him looks, by all appearances, like a well-behaved young lady from a wealthy family. But Doha has never been one to turn down a woman, so he readily accepts her offer...  \n\n‘Wait, did I seriously just fall for her because of that? Nah, no way.’\n\nBut there's something about this woman...   \n\nShe's exactly Kim Doha's type!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002984)",
